### =========================================================================
### Student Profile and Skill Development Management System - REST API Tests
### Run StudentManagementApplication first!
### =========================================================================

### 1. (Q3.2) Retrieve All Students (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students
Accept: application/json

### 2. (Q3.1) Add a New Student (POST - 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 105,
  "studentName": "Vikram Malhotra",
  "email": "vikram@gmail.com",
  "course": "CSE",
  "programmingScore": 88.0,
  "mathematicsScore": 94.0,
  "technicalSkills": ["Java", "Docker", "AWS"]
}

### 3. (Q2.8) Test Duplicate Student ID Prevention (POST - 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 101,
  "studentName": "Duplicate Tester",
  "email": "duplicate@gmail.com",
  "course": "CSE",
  "programmingScore": 70.0,
  "mathematicsScore": 75.0,
  "technicalSkills": ["Python"]
}

### 4. (Q2.8) Test Invalid Score Validation > 100 (POST - 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 106,
  "studentName": "Invalid Score Tester",
  "email": "invalid@gmail.com",
  "course": "CSE",
  "programmingScore": 150.0,
  "mathematicsScore": 85.0,
  "technicalSkills": ["Java"]
}

### 5. (Q3.3) Search Student by ID (GET - 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/101
Accept: application/json

### 6. (Q3.3) Search Non-Existent Student ID (GET - 404 NOT FOUND)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/999
Accept: application/json

### 7. (Q3.6 & Q2.5) Display the Merit List (Sorted by Average Score DESC)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/merit-list
Accept: application/json

### 8. (Q3.4) Update Student Scores and Skills (PUT - 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/102
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "programmingScore": 85.0,
  "mathematicsScore": 90.0,
  "technicalSkills": ["Python", "MySQL", "Django", "Machine Learning"]
}

### 9. (Q2.6) Identify Students Grouped by Same Technical Skills (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/skills-grouped
Accept: application/json

### 10. (Q2.7) Students Needing Programming Improvement (< 50) with Math >= 75
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/programming-improvement-math-strong
Accept: application/json

### 11. (Q2.4) Search Students by Course (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/search?course=CSE
Accept: application/json

### 12. (Q3.5) Delete Student Record (DELETE - 200 OK)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/104
